{
  "title": "EC2 · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "운영 체제와 인스턴스 유형을 선택해 실행하는 가상 서버다.",
  "main": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"현재 위치\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>EC2 <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Compute Cloud)</span></span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/#instance-families\">Instance Families</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/#general-purpose-instances\">General Purpose Instances</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/#compute-optimized-instances\">Compute Optimized Instances</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/#memory-optimized-instances\">Memory Optimized Instances</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/#storage-optimized-instances\">Storage Optimized Instances</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/#accelerated-computing-instances\">Accelerated Computing Instances</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/#high-performance-computing-instances\">High Performance Computing Instances</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/#burstable-performance-and-cpu-credits\">Burstable Performance and CPU Credits</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/#fixed-performance-and-flex-instances\">Fixed Performance and Flex Instances</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/#ec2-purchasing-options\">EC2 Purchasing Options</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/#instance-type-and-architecture\">Instance Type and Architecture</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/#ami-and-launch-template\">AMI and Launch Template</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/#instance-lifecycle\">Instance Lifecycle</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/#ebs-and-instance-store\">EBS and Instance Store</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/#networking-and-security\">Networking and Security</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/#iam-role-and-imdsv2\">IAM Role and IMDSv2</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/#user-data-and-monitoring\">User Data and Monitoring</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>컴퓨팅</span><span>15 / 62</span></div><h1>EC2 <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Compute Cloud)</span></h1><p class=\"article-date\">공식 문서 확인 2026-09-30 · 17 subtopics</p></header><section id=\"overview\" class=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>EC2 <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Compute Cloud)</span>는 AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span>에서 OS를 가진 Compute Instance를 실행하는 서비스다. Instance Type으로 CPU <span class=\"full-name\">(Central Processing Unit)</span>·Memory·Network·Storage 성능을 선택하고 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ami/\">AMI</a>로 시작할 OS·Software를 정한다.</p><p>AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span>는 기반 시설을 관리하지만 사용자는 Guest OS 패치, 애플리케이션, 권한과 데이터 보호 등을 책임진다. Compute, Network, Storage, 구매 옵션은 서로 다른 선택 축이다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" aria-label=\"EC2 실행 구성과 영구 상태\"><figure class=\"diagram\"><figcaption><b>EC2 실행 구성과 영구 상태</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><div class=\"visual-lanes\"><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Launch</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ami/\">AMI</a> + <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/#launch-template\">Launch Template</a></strong><small>OS·앱 Image와 실행 설정</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong>Instance Type + Subnet</strong><small>Compute·Network 선택</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>EC2 <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Compute Cloud)</span></strong><small>사용자가 OS·앱 관리</small></div></div><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Data lifetime</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/\">EBS</a></strong><small>영구 Block Volume</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong>Snapshot</strong><small>시점 Backup·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> 이동</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>New EC2 <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Compute Cloud)</span></strong><small>Restore 후 연결·앱 복구</small></div></div></div><p class=\"diagram-note\"><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#instance-store\">Instance Store</a>·Memory의 상태는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ami/\">AMI</a>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/\">EBS</a> 보존과 구분한다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"instance-families\"><h2>Instance Families<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/#instance-families\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>General Purpose는 균형형, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/snowball-edge/#compute-optimized\">Compute Optimized</a>는 CPU <span class=\"full-name\">(Central Processing Unit)</span> 중심, Memory Optimized는 큰 Memory 중심이다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/snowball-edge/#storage-optimized\">Storage Optimized</a>와 Accelerated Computing, HPC <span class=\"full-name\">(High Performance Computing)</span> Optimized도 있다. 실제 병목에 맞춰 Family와 Generation·Size를 선택한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"general-purpose-instances\"><h2>General Purpose Instances<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/#general-purpose-instances\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/#reference-2\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 2\">[2]</a></h2><p>CPU <span class=\"full-name\">(Central Processing Unit)</span>·Memory·Network를 균형 있게 제공하는 Family다. M 계열은 일반 앱·중간 규모 DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> 등 여러 자원을 함께 쓰는 Workload에 비교한다. T 계열의 Burstable 모델은 같은 General Purpose 분류 안에서도 CPU <span class=\"full-name\">(Central Processing Unit)</span> Credit 조건이 다르다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"compute-optimized-instances\"><h2>Compute Optimized Instances<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/#compute-optimized-instances\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/#reference-3\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 3\">[3]</a></h2><p>CPU <span class=\"full-name\">(Central Processing Unit)</span> 비중이 큰 Batch·Encoding·계산 Workload에 맞춘 C 계열 등의 분류다. 먼저 CPU <span class=\"full-name\">(Central Processing Unit)</span> Utilization과 Thread 병렬성이 병목인지 확인한다. Memory나 Storage I/O <span class=\"full-name\">(Input/Output)</span>가 부족한 문제를 CPU <span class=\"full-name\">(Central Processing Unit)</span>만 늘려 해결하려 하면 비용만 증가할 수 있다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"memory-optimized-instances\"><h2>Memory Optimized Instances<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/#memory-optimized-instances\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/#reference-4\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 4\">[4]</a></h2><p>큰 Working Set·In-memory Database·Cache·분석에 맞는 R·X·High Memory 계열 등을 포함한다. Instance별 vCPU 대비 Memory와 최대 용량·Network를 비교한다. Large Memory를 선택해도 Query·Index의 비효율이 자동 사라지는 것은 아니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"storage-optimized-instances\"><h2>Storage Optimized Instances<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/#storage-optimized-instances\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/#reference-5\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 5\">[5]</a></h2><p>높은 Local Storage I/O <span class=\"full-name\">(Input/Output)</span>·대용량 저장 처리에 맞는 I·D 계열 등을 포함한다. NVMe SSD <span class=\"full-name\">(Solid State Drive)</span>·HDD <span class=\"full-name\">(Hard Disk Drive)</span> 구성과 Sequential·Random I/O <span class=\"full-name\">(Input/Output)</span> 요구를 구분한다. Local <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#instance-store\">Instance Store</a>의 수명·장애 특성 때문에 영구 원본은 복제·Backup이 필요하다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"accelerated-computing-instances\"><h2>Accelerated Computing Instances<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/#accelerated-computing-instances\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/#reference-6\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 6\">[6]</a></h2><p>GPU·Inference·Training·FPGA·Video 같은 가속 Hardware를 사용하는 분류다. P·G·Inf·Trn 등은 대상 연산과 Software 지원이 다르다. 앱 Framework·Driver·Model이 해당 가속기를 활용할 수 있는지 확인한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"high-performance-computing-instances\"><h2>High Performance Computing Instances<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/#high-performance-computing-instances\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/#reference-7\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 7\">[7]</a></h2><p>대규모 병렬 계산의 CPU <span class=\"full-name\">(Central Processing Unit)</span>·Memory·Network 효율을 위한 Hpc 계열이다. CFD·과학 계산처럼 노드 간 통신이 집중되는 Workload에 비교한다. 지원 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eni/#prefix-delegation-and-efa\">EFA</a>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/placement/\">Placement Group</a>과 병렬 Runtime 구성이 실제 성능에 영향을 준다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"burstable-performance-and-cpu-credits\"><h2>Burstable Performance and CPU <span class=\"full-name\">(Central Processing Unit)</span> Credits<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/#burstable-performance-and-cpu-credits\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/#reference-8\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 8\">[8]</a></h2><p>T 계열은 Baseline CPU <span class=\"full-name\">(Central Processing Unit)</span> 성능과 CPU <span class=\"full-name\">(Central Processing Unit)</span> Credit으로 추가 Burst를 제공한다. Standard Mode는 Credit 소진 때 Baseline 제약을, Unlimited는 지원 추가 Credit 과금을 고려한다. 지속적으로 높은 CPU <span class=\"full-name\">(Central Processing Unit)</span>를 쓰면 Fixed Performance와 전체 비용을 비교한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"fixed-performance-and-flex-instances\"><h2>Fixed Performance and Flex Instances<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/#fixed-performance-and-flex-instances\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/#reference-8\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 8\">[8]</a></h2><p>Fixed Performance는 지속적인 CPU <span class=\"full-name\">(Central Processing Unit)</span> 사용에 적합하고 Flex는 Baseline을 넘어 Burst할 수 있는 별도 성능 모델이다. Flex의 동작을 T 계열 CPU <span class=\"full-name\">(Central Processing Unit)</span> Credit 모델과 동일하게 가정하지 않는다. 지속 Peak·SLA가 엄격하면 해당 Type의 성능 설명을 확인한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"ec2-purchasing-options\"><h2>EC2 <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Compute Cloud)</span> Purchasing Options<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/#ec2-purchasing-options\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/#reference-9\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 9\">[9]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#on-demand-instances\">On-Demand</a>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#spot-instances\">Spot</a>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#compute-savings-plans\">Savings Plans</a>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#standard-reserved-instances\">Reserved Instances</a>는 약정·중단 가능성과 할인 조건을 비교한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#dedicated-hosts\">Dedicated Hosts</a>와 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#dedicated-instances\">Dedicated Instances</a>는 Hardware Tenancy·제어 요구를, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/#on-demand-capacity-reservations\">Capacity Reservation</a>은 특정 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>의 실행 용량을 다룬다. 각 유형의 상세 조건은 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/pricing/\">EC2 Purchasing Options</a> 문서에서 비교할 수 있다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"instance-type-and-architecture\"><h2>Instance Type and Architecture<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/#instance-type-and-architecture\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Instance Type은 Family·Generation·Size를 조합한다. x86과 Arm 기반 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ami/\">AMI</a>·Binary 호환성도 확인한다. vCPU 수만 늘리는 것이 Disk I/O <span class=\"full-name\">(Input/Output)</span>나 Network 제한을 항상 해결하지는 않는다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"ami-and-launch-template\"><h2>AMI <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Machine Image)</span> and Launch Template<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/#ami-and-launch-template\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ami/\">AMI</a>는 OS·Software 이미지와 연결할 Volume 구성을 제공한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/#launch-template\">Launch Template</a>은 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ami/\">AMI</a>, Instance Type, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">Security Group</a>, User Data 등 시작 설정을 묶는다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/\">Auto Scaling</a>은 재현 가능한 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/#launch-template\">Launch Template</a>을 사용한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"instance-lifecycle\"><h2>Instance Lifecycle<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/#instance-lifecycle\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Pending, Running, Stopping, Stopped, Shutting-down, Terminated 상태를 구분한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/\">EBS</a>-backed Instance를 Stop하면 Compute 실행은 중지되지만 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/\">EBS</a> 등의 비용은 남는다. Terminate의 데이터 보존은 Volume의 DeleteOnTermination 설정을 확인한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"ebs-and-instance-store\"><h2>EBS <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Block Store)</span> and Instance Store<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/#ebs-and-instance-store\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ebs/\">EBS</a>는 별도 지속형 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#block-storage\">Block Storage</a>다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/types/#instance-store\">Instance Store</a>는 Host에 붙은 임시 Storage로 Stop·Terminate·Host 장애에서 데이터가 사라질 수 있다. 빠른 임시 Cache와 반드시 보존할 데이터의 저장 위치를 분리한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"networking-and-security\"><h2>Networking and Security<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/#networking-and-security\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>EC2 <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Compute Cloud)</span>는 Subnet의 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eni/\">ENI</a>와 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">Security Group</a>으로 Network에 연결된다. Public 접근에는 주소·Route·정책이 필요하다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/#private-subnet\">Private Subnet</a>에 배치한 EC2 <span class=\"full-name\">(Elastic Compute Cloud)</span>도 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT</a>·Endpoint 등으로 필요한 외부 서비스에 접근할 수 있다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"iam-role-and-imdsv2\"><h2>IAM <span class=\"full-name\">(Identity and Access Management)</span> Role and IMDSv2 <span class=\"full-name\">(Instance Metadata Service version 2)</span><a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/#iam-role-and-imdsv2\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/#iam-roles\">Instance Profile</a>의 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/#iam-roles\">IAM Role</a>로 임시 AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span> Credential을 제공한다. IMDSv2 <span class=\"full-name\">(Instance Metadata Service version 2)</span>는 Token 기반으로 Instance Metadata에 접근한다. Access Key를 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ami/\">AMI</a>나 User Data에 박아 넣는 방식보다 역할 기반 최소 권한이 적합하다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"user-data-and-monitoring\"><h2>User Data and Monitoring<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/#user-data-and-monitoring\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>User Data는 시작 시 Software 설치·구성을 자동화하는 데 사용한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/audit/#cloudwatch-metrics-and-alarms\">CloudWatch</a> 기본 지표 외에 OS Memory·Disk 사용률 등은 Agent가 필요할 수 있다. 설정 변경 후 새 Instance에도 같은 구성이 적용되는지 확인한다.</p></section><section id=\"scenario\" class=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>CPU <span class=\"full-name\">(Central Processing Unit)</span>보다 메모리가 먼저 부족한 앱은 Memory Optimized를 비교한다. 갑자기 요청이 늘 때는 단일 서버 확대와 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#application-load-balancer\">ALB</a>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/\">Auto Scaling</a>을 통한 수평 확장을 함께 검토한다.</p></section><aside class=\"tip\"><b>시험에서 구별할 점</b><p>인스턴스 하나만 실행하면 고가용성이 자동으로 생기지 않는다.</p></aside><section id=\"references\" class=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><p>위 첨자는 아래 공식 문서로 연결됩니다. 서비스 제공 조건은 확인일 기준입니다.</p><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AWSEC2/latest/UserGuide/concepts.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">AWSEC2/latest/UserGuide/concepts.html ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-2\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/ec2/latest/instancetypes/gp.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ec2/latest/instancetypes/gp.html ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-3\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/ec2/latest/instancetypes/co.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ec2/latest/instancetypes/co.html ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-4\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/ec2/latest/instancetypes/mo.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ec2/latest/instancetypes/mo.html ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-5\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/ec2/latest/instancetypes/so.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ec2/latest/instancetypes/so.html ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-6\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/ec2/latest/instancetypes/ac.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ec2/latest/instancetypes/ac.html ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-7\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/ec2/latest/instancetypes/hpc.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ec2/latest/instancetypes/hpc.html ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-8\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/ec2/latest/instancetypes/instance-types.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">ec2/latest/instancetypes/instance-types.html ↗</a></li><li id=\"reference-9\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/AWSEC2/latest/UserGuide/instance-purchasing-options.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">AWSEC2/latest/UserGuide/instance-purchasing-options.html ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section id=\"practice\" class=\"related-questions\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q002/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q002\" data-question=\"Q002\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"3\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q002</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q002/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A web tier must withstand a data center failure within one Region. Which deployment is most appropriate?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q002\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Two ENIs on the same EC2 instance</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q002\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Two instances using one EBS volume</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q002\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Two instances in a single Availability Zone</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q002\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Instances deployed across different Availability Zones</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>는 독립적인 장애 영역이다. 서로 다른 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>의 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">서브넷</a>에 웹 인스턴스를 둔다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">Subnet / CIDR</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q012\" data-question=\"Q012\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q012</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q012/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Which logical networking resource associated with an EC2 instance includes IP addresses and security groups?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q012\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">An ENI</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q012\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">An Availability Zone</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q012\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An AMI</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q012\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">An SCP</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eni/\">ENI</a>에는 프라이빗 IP <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol)</span>와 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">SG</a> 등의 네트워크 속성이 연결된다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eni/\">ENI</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">Security Group</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q016\" data-question=\"Q016\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q016</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q016/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An EC2 instance must retain the same public IPv4 address after it restarts. Which resource should be considered?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q016\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">An S3 Access Point</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q016\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">A change to the ENI MAC address</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q016\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An Elastic IP address</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q016\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS PrivateLink</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eip/\">EIP</a>는 계정에 할당하는 고정 공인 IPv4 <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol version 4)</span> 주소다. 비용과 장애 조치 설계는 별개다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eip/\">Elastic IP</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q026\" data-question=\"Q026\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q026</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q026/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company is selecting a new EC2 instance for CPU-intensive image encoding. Which instance family should it evaluate first?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q026\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Compute optimized</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q026\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Burstable micro instances only</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q026\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Storage optimized only</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q026\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Memory optimized only</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · CPU <span class=\"full-name\">(Central Processing Unit)</span> 중심 워크로드는 컴퓨팅 최적화 패밀리를 우선 검토한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q027\" data-question=\"Q027\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q027</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q027/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company needs to repeatedly launch EC2 instances with the same operating system and application. Which template should it use?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q027\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">An Elastic IP address</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q027\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">A network ACL</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q027\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">An AMI</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q027\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon SNS</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ami/\">AMI</a>가 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a> 시작 이미지를 제공한다. 런타임의 변경 데이터는 별도 저장해야 한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ami/\">AMI</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a></div></article></section><nav class=\"sequence\" aria-label=\"용어 이동\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/snapshot/\">이전 용어 <b>EBS Snapshot</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/asg/\">다음 용어 <b>EC2 Auto Scaling</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
